# Trained model artifacts - derived from training, not source data,
# regenerable by re-running the pipeline. Keep out of git.
*.npz
*.npy
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Note: raw EEG (*.edf) is intentionally versioned in this repo (see
# DATASET.md) - it's public-domain (CC0) OpenNeuro data, not private
# subject data. Keep additions to short calibration-task recordings
# (few MB each); avoid committing full closed-loop/6-minute session
# blocks in bulk, to keep repo size reasonable.
